<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
  <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
  <title>邮箱验证码</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;word-spacing:normal;background-color:#f5f5f5;">
  <table role="presentation" style="width:100%;background-color:#f5f5f5;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">
        <!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" style="width:480px;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
        <table role="presentation" style="width:100%;max-width:480px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:40px 24px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a;">邮箱验证码</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 28px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#555555;line-height:1.6;">您正在请求一次身份验证，请在页面中输入以下验证码：</p>
              <table role="presentation" style="width:100%;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding:20px 16px;background-color:#f0fdf4;border-radius:8px;">
                    <span style="font-family:Menlo,Monaco,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:32px;letter-spacing:6px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;">{{code}}</span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#888888;line-height:1.6;">验证码 5 分钟内有效，请勿转发给他人。</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#bbbbbb;text-align:center;">系统邮件，请勿回复</p>
        <!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>